tMWIv9cueOFTFA"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1aV411r7ZW","aid":413454824,"title":"GreatBay_SZ 2020项目介绍","author":"LostGlass","mid":9903315,"duration":"6:35","pic":"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bcc0e61c1cef538a996220fc9a0d4bdbe3e96f12.jpg","play":1121,"video_review":1,"pubdate":1591453701,"tag":"自然,化学,科学,物质,生物","description":"潮湿驱动的蛋白质发电装置\n\n潮湿广泛分布各种生态环境中，是一种既绿色又对环境条件要求极低的清洁能源。但是目前潮湿发电的相关技术难以实现自发且持续性的产能过程。\n我们队伍今年的目标便是利用生物技术来开发一种高效、自发且稳定的潮湿发电技术。一种产自硫还原地杆菌的纳米蛋白丝是我们项目的核心。我们将通过合成生物学的方法降低这种产电蛋白纳米丝的成本，提高其产电效率，同时开发硬件推动这种绿色且高效的蛋白质发电技术在可穿戴设备、家用小型电器以及体内电子检测设备等方面的应用。"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1E441197g5","aid":64759617,"title":"「翻译」JavaScript 中的 Event Loop - Jake Archibald","author":"Melo郭师傅","mid":8627549,"duration":"35:12","pic":"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/db3b4450da5eaf7ab9b8be4f4b7cf05e930fcdba.jpg","play":2781,"video_review":3,"pubdate":1566395058,"tag":"教育,JavaScript,Event Loop,Chrome,前端,编程","description":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cCOL7MC4Pl0&amp;list=PL7fryLwojljcmswusNlomaDkeQnKI22Ie&amp;index=10&amp;t=748s\n你有没有遇到过类似这种bug，比如代码乱序执行或者样式的更改被忽略？你是不曾经通过把代码包在 setTimeout 里面来解决问题？是不是这种方式不太可靠？然后你就不断调试 timeout 值，最好看起来好像没问题了。\n这个演讲关注事件循环，它负责协调浏览器的主线程，包含了 JavaScript，事件和渲染。"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1w44y127y3","aid":974641346,"title":"［法  国  hiphop  战  队  s t y l e z   C  杀  封  疯  了！］","author":"你的私人_swag-TV","mid":2079159096,"duration":"10:2","pic":"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/171855d5424a30c4f64db7cb15b939c0dd4a3603.jpg","play":1522,"video_review":0,"pubdate":1628587256,"tag":"现场,即兴,BATTLE,HIPHOP,FREESTYLE,比赛","description":"https://youtu.be/NDrPNfdOOPE"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1bdpu6KEnT","aid":117416789083828,"title":"ttcbeyJrZXkiOiJ6bGlua19zY2hlbWVfbWQ1X2IwOTcwOGY5ZWJjNmUyMDIwYTQzZGQ4NzRhN","author":"用户leprHAsefaee","mid":3546791016401801,"duration":"0:39","pic":"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b21f7b40e0ed15e872e6f53b50491a20dcddb2fa.jpg","play":349,"video_review":0,"pubdate":1791638222,"tag":"dreamcore,arg,core","description":"-"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1tJHA6kEKL",